{
"markdown": "### Taffy\n\n**Taffy** brings the stretchy sliders from iOS 17 to iOS 16. Pull a slider past its maximum or minimum, and it gently stretches in the direction you're pulling, then springs back when you let go.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
