"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **Control Center Sliders:** Works with the brightness and volume sliders in Control Center (both compact and expanded).\n- **Volume HUD:** Volume HUD that appears when you press the volume buttons (in portrait and landscape).\n- **Media Player:** Volume and playback sliders of the media player in Control Center and on the Lock Screen.",
